  - window:
      chain: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f56f5404d52f9d54b8a85aef8788703a, type: 2}
      from: 
      until: favour-log-move
    lines:
    - Oh! A tall one. Could you... the log. It rolled off the woodpile and now I
      can't get in my own front door.
    offerChain: 1
    question: Will you shift it for me?
    yesLabel: Of course
    noLabel: Not now
    acceptedLine: Bless you! Push it, pull it, anything!
    declinedLine: Another time, then.
  - window:
      chain: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f56f5404d52f9d54b8a85aef8788703a, type: 2}
      from: favour-log-move
